                <pb facs="0649" n="553" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg553"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Donaldson to Mr. Merry.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Dispatched Managua, February 12, 1899.</p>
                <p>Received San José, February 13, 1899.</p>
                <p>An American vessel has arrived at Grey town. I suppose her to be the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Machias</hi>. I beg you to give me instructions to
                    communicate. There is nothing new. Rest of the country obeys the Government.
                    Captain leaves to-morrow (for) Bluefields.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
